ed-subset/unserved_backlog runtime boundary and preserve conservative visual/rights posture.\n\nCloses #1161\n\n## Boundaries\n\n- No SourceFigureAsset is accepted or approved for student display in this issue.\n- No VLM call was performed.\n- No remote Supabase mutation or Phase B2 eligibility is claimed.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `npm test -- --runInBand --runTestsByPath scripts/method-map/__tests__/full-beta-runtime-source-map.test.js` passed: 1 suite, 5 tests.\n- `node scripts/method-map/build-full-beta-runtime-source-map.mjs --check` passed: 20 validator checks, artifact files match generated output.\n- `git diff --check` passed.\n- `npm run workflow:codex-preflight -- --json` exited 0; warning only for the expected dirty worktree before commit and branch naming (`feat/issue-1161`). Report/artifact guard and A+ ratchet were healthy.\n","created_at":"2026-07-02T09:23:58Z","updated_at":"2026-07-02T09:44:46Z","closed_at":"2026-07-02T09:44:46Z","merged_at":"2026-07-02T09:44:46Z","merge_commit_sha":"e8f7915c11ef94f1eef71db22f39080bb439f330","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1174/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1174/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1174/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/statuses/669ec2b8f4cc9f290b0419679122045e0028c4c7","head":{"label":"Samsen879:feat/issue-1161","ref":"feat/issue-1161","sha":"669ec2b8f4cc9f290b0419679122045e0028c4c7","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https